WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.801
Welcome, welcome, welcome
to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:04.234
You're here!
You're watching!

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:06.501
[ Cheers and applause ]
Thank you.

00:00:06.501 --> 00:00:08.167
Happy Tuesday, everybody.

00:00:08.167 --> 00:00:10.667
Happy Twosday.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.801
-Ahh, yes.
-With a "W."

00:00:13.801 --> 00:00:18.801
'Cause -- yeah, "Twosday"
because it's Tuesday 2-22-22.

00:00:18.801 --> 00:00:23.534
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.534 --> 00:00:26.934
Yeah, this only happens once
every 100 years.

00:00:26.934 --> 00:00:28.868
President Biden was like,
"I didn't care then.

00:00:28.868 --> 00:00:30.234
I didn't care now."
I --

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:31.367
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.367 --> 00:00:34.367
[ Rimshot ]
Speaking of the President --

00:00:34.367 --> 00:00:37.501
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:39.601
Biden gave a speech
at the White House

00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:43.200
and said that Russia's invasion
of Ukraine has officially begun.

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:44.434
Biden didn't mean to say that,

00:00:44.434 --> 00:00:46.234
but Putin invaded
his teleprompter, too.

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:47.734
[ Laughter ]
Yeah.

00:00:47.734 --> 00:00:50.400
Yeah, Biden said, "We will not
put up with Russian aggression,

00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.834
especially on such an important
national holiday, 'Twosday.'"

00:00:53.834 --> 00:00:58.133
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.133 --> 00:00:59.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:04.567
It's 2-2 --"
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:04.567 --> 00:01:06.801
Biden also used his speech
to announce a bunch

00:01:06.801 --> 00:01:09.467
of new sanctions against Russia.

00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:11.734
Yeah, nothing stops a dictator
in his tracks

00:01:11.734 --> 00:01:13.367
like raising his ATM fees.

00:01:13.367 --> 00:01:14.868
Yeah, of course.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.868 --> 00:01:16.834
Russia was like,
"We get two hours of sunlight

00:01:16.834 --> 00:01:19.300
and eat potatoes every meal.
What are you going to take away?

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.834
What are you going
to take away from us?"

00:01:20.834 --> 00:01:22.400
[ Laughter ]

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:23.634
Well, this is going viral.

00:01:23.634 --> 00:01:25.734
A journalist in Ukraine
was reporting the news

00:01:25.734 --> 00:01:28.734
on the Russia crisis
in six different languages

00:01:28.734 --> 00:01:30.234
and nailed it.
Check this out.

00:01:30.234 --> 00:01:32.634
-There's been a war
with Russian-backed forces.

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:35.133
[ Speaking Luxembourgish ]

00:01:35.133 --> 00:01:37.968
[ Speaking Spanish ]

00:01:37.968 --> 00:01:40.033
[ Speaking Portuguese ]

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.334
[ Speaking French ]

00:01:42.334 --> 00:01:46.167
[ Speaking German ]

00:01:46.167 --> 00:01:47.234
-Whoa.

00:01:47.234 --> 00:01:49.234
♪♪

00:01:49.234 --> 00:01:52.901
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Yeah.

00:01:52.901 --> 00:01:54.601
He also knows
six different ways to say,

00:01:54.601 --> 00:01:56.434
"I'm ready to leave Ukraine now.
Okay?"

00:01:56.434 --> 00:01:57.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.667 --> 00:02:01.234
"We can make this a Zoom."
Yeah, it's all good.

00:02:01.234 --> 00:02:03.267
Some news --
Some news here in the U.S.

00:02:03.267 --> 00:02:07.000
A woman running for Congress
in Oklahoma has apologized

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:09.834
after she mixed wine
and sleep medication,

00:02:09.834 --> 00:02:12.100
yelled at a bunch of
12- and 13-year-old girls

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:14.901
at a sleepover, and then
threw up in one of their shoes.

00:02:14.901 --> 00:02:19.901
[ Laughter ]

00:02:19.901 --> 00:02:21.434
The kids at the sleepover
were torn.

00:02:21.434 --> 00:02:23.767
They didn't know whether to help
her or film it for TikTok.

00:02:23.767 --> 00:02:25.133
They were like, "Aah!"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.133 --> 00:02:27.601
"Aah! This is too good."

00:02:27.601 --> 00:02:29.901
Yeah, well, after --
Guys, after 25 years,

00:02:29.901 --> 00:02:32.868
PBS just aired
the final episode of "Arthur."

00:02:32.868 --> 00:02:34.133
[ Audience "Awws" ]
I know.

00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:37.767
And it showed
all the characters as adults.

00:02:37.767 --> 00:02:38.767
Can we see
what Arthur looks like --

00:02:38.767 --> 00:02:40.968
this is real --
all grown up?

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:48.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:50.467
Can we see that again?
This is -- yeah.

00:02:50.467 --> 00:02:52.767
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.767 --> 00:02:54.734
Apparently, he grew up
to be your weed dealer.

00:02:54.734 --> 00:02:57.767
[ Laughter ]
Wow.

00:02:57.767 --> 00:02:59.300
Finally, guys,
this is kind of odd,

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.300
but a new study found
that Viagra could be

00:03:01.300 --> 00:03:04.234
a life-changing drug for dogs.

00:03:04.234 --> 00:03:05.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:07.234
It's pretty wild,
but it's inspired Viagra

00:03:07.234 --> 00:03:08.801
to come up
with some new slogans.

00:03:08.801 --> 00:03:10.434
Here, check some of these out.
First up, there's,

00:03:10.434 --> 00:03:12.434
"Viagra..."

00:03:14.033 --> 00:03:17.100
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:19.100
Next up there's, "Viagra..."

00:03:21.667 --> 00:03:23.801
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.801 --> 00:03:25.801
And finally, there's,
"Viagra..."

